  "ed.tdf": [
    "}A place that looks like a grave..",
    "}Claire stands in front, wearing casual clothes with her hair down.@ ",
    "}Behind her, Ian and Lea can be seen.@",
    "'[Ian]@ What were you thinking when you freed the Guardian, Claire?",
    "|[Claire]@ No reason. I just remembered it while listening to Ulrike.",
    "'[Ian]@ ...;What do you plan to do now?",
    "|[Claire]@ Well..; What about you?",
    "'[Ian]@ Well, I've accomplished half of what I set out to do with your help, of course. I suppose I should finish the other half.",
    "|[Claire]@ You mean protecting the people of Soltia?",
    "'[Ian]@ And there's still the matter of the independence movement.",
    "|[Claire]@ I was thinking I'd just look after the kids at the orphanage.",
    "'[Ian]@ The orphanage?",
    "|[Claire]@ Yeah."
