    "Basic Controls",
    "Skill",
    "Beast",
    "Status",
    "Equipment",
    "Item Crafting and Enhancement",
    "Network",
    "Developer",
    "Move: D-Pad, 2,4,6,8;Inspect/Talk: OK, 5;Normal Attack: OK, 5;Skill: 1, 3, 7, 9;Recovery Item: 0;Switch Recovery Item: #;Mini-map : *;Menu: R ",
    "Each combat style has unique passive/active skills.;Passives are always on; actives use a hotkey.;Skills come from quests and leveling; spend skill points to unlock and upgrade them.",
    "Equip a beast to use its skills.;Spend skill points to unlock/upgrade them, then assign a hotkey.;Beasts grow with you and learn new skills by evolving.;Buy, evolve, or swap beasts at the Beast Manager.",
    "Leveling up grants stat points to raise your abilities.;STR: attack/defense. VIT: HP and regen. AGI: accuracy, evasion, critical. WIL: SP and regen. INT: critical and beast skills.;HP/SP regen slowly; SP is used when attacking, and usage varies by weapon.",
    "Equipment has a required level and required honor.;Below the required level, it can't be worn.;Below the required honor, it can be worn but won't reach full power.;Raise honor via Network Battles.",
    "The Alchemist crafts items and enchants weapons.;Orbs add traits; trait weapons can trigger special effects.;Crystals add elements.;Seals add/replace stat options (STR, VIT, etc).;The Blacksmith refines gear - failure destroys it.",
    "Battle other players online, team up for 4-player fights, and join a guild for support and guild wars. Trade items with others at the marketplace.;Downloading Network Battle is free; call charges apply separately.",
